WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:01.450
- This is the beauty of Dubai.

00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:03.010
It's just because it's a city

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:05.720
where we have all nationalities
of the world, you know?

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:08.920
Everybody has his own
angle, his own world,

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:11.580
his own point of view on a situation.

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:13.760
So, if you bring everybody
in the same place,

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:16.573
we'll see fireworks of creativity.

00:00:17.548 --> 00:00:19.030
- [Anna] I'm Anna Devis.

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:20.850
- [Daniel] I'm Daniel Rueda.

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:23.820
- [Anna] Together we are
architects and photographers.

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:26.040
- [Daniel] Our approach is
to play with perspectives

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:28.600
and geometry within an urban landscape.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:29.680
- [Anna] And as architects,

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.930
we travel the world exploring
unseen aspects of buildings

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:35.391
so we can tell stories through the image.

00:00:35.391 --> 00:00:37.350
- [Daniel] We are on a
journey to meet with other

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:39.913
like-minded and inspiring
creatives in Dubai.

00:00:41.296 --> 00:00:43.313
(upbeat electronic music)

00:00:43.313 --> 00:00:44.880
- [Anna] Here, we will
meet with spontaneous

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:47.110
content creator, Remy Abouchakra

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:49.550
We meet with Remy to
share artistic approaches

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:53.240
and we'll begin by taking in
a bird's eye view of Dubai.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.290
- [Remy] I'm in Dubai
since three years now,

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:58.490
so a lot of people knows me
here as A French in Dubai.

00:00:58.490 --> 00:00:59.870
I do my own content,

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:02.950
I do from photo and video, stop motion.

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:05.930
I pull out that I can take from my camera,

00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:07.030
from my phone.

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:11.350
I like to try to find
innovative content everyday.

00:01:11.350 --> 00:01:12.860
And to be unique.

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:15.260
I think Dubai's a fantastic
city to create content.

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:17.390
You have a lot of different places.

00:01:17.390 --> 00:01:19.750
Because it looks good and
people already experience it.

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:21.670
But you want to try to find a new angle,

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:24.020
actually, to have your own creation.

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:27.090
I don't plan too much
recorded or freestyle shoot.

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:30.510
I play with light, with shape,
with shadows, with motion.

00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:33.700
I have this idea, and I go
on the street, I shoot it,

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:36.550
I do a quick edit on my
computer and post it.

00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:38.920
- [Daniel] It is this impulsive
style of Remy's photography

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:40.570
that is so interesting to us.

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:43.130
The way his mind works fast
to complete a narrative

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:45.293
for his imagery is fascinating.

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:51.950
I think your pictures are
also very easy to catch.

00:01:51.950 --> 00:01:55.570
Very bold, you can really
see what he was looking for.

00:01:55.570 --> 00:01:56.403
But at the same time,

00:01:56.403 --> 00:01:58.920
we are achieving that
in very different ways.

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:01.180
We are more staged, theatrical.

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:04.430
While he is more fresh
and dynamic and quick.

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:06.108
- The geometry for it is super important.

00:02:06.108 --> 00:02:08.220
Because you play a lot with symmetry.

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:09.638
- [Anna] We are architects, so.

00:02:09.638 --> 00:02:12.180
- For us it's impossible not
to think about those things.

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:15.330
We like to find places that
has the same kind of pictures

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:17.320
from the same distance,
the same focal length,

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:18.880
and you change those things a little bit.

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:21.610
Maybe add some humor or like a prop.

00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:25.520
Or a certain outfit or a
certain perspective or distance.

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:27.540
- [Anna] Everything in
the frame is considered.

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:30.040
We buy paint, wardrobe and props.

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:33.680
Sometimes, even make them
if the image needs it.

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:36.263
(upbeat music)

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:40.410
- [Daniel] Dubai it's really
easy to step back a little bit

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:41.890
and you can take it all in,

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:44.420
how the beautiful design and the facades.

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:47.274
They have a much more
creative spirit in the design.

00:02:47.274 --> 00:02:51.030
(soothing electronic music)

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:52.450
Once you get up to the top,

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:54.703
you can see how everything
was so taken care of.

00:02:54.703 --> 00:02:56.780
And you can see all the details.

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:58.200
You can see how everything was done

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:01.360
to be beautiful and geometric.

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:03.360
- [Anna] We've seen so many unique aspects

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:06.510
to Dubai's skyline while
visiting with Remy.

00:03:06.510 --> 00:03:08.514
It's been eye-opening
learning about his approach

00:03:08.514 --> 00:03:11.023
and comparing and collaborating with him.

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:13.740
- [Remy] I think I'm a really hard worker.

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:15.543
I work maybe six days per week.

00:03:15.543 --> 00:03:17.520
I really like this city for that.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:19.090
You get a lot of opportunities,

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:22.680
you can do your own projects,
you can grow very fast.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:24.530
And I think this is the beauty of it.

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:28.520
Everybody can be a content creator today.

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:29.950
What's a content creator?

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:31.970
It's not just me, it can
be you, it can be you,

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:33.010
it can be anyone.

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:35.960
I don't even know if I will be
a photographer in two years.

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:37.970
And I like that.

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:39.915
- [Anna] It is this
creativity that inspired us

00:03:39.915 --> 00:03:42.920
to even create our own
image while in Dubai.

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:45.410
And we'll take Remy's
adventurous thinking home with us

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:47.090
for future projects.

00:03:47.090 --> 00:03:49.354
- I'm living the dream, beautiful right?

00:03:49.354 --> 00:03:53.187
- (soothing electronic music)

